---
// deals-what-is-claudekit: primer for readers who land on /guides/deals
// without prior context. Explains ClaudeKit value, links to the ClaudeKit
// author's public origin-story post on Facebook, and curates the most
// relevant guide pages.
import { useTranslations } from '@/i18n/utils';
import { getLangFromUrl, type Language } from '@/i18n';
import { SquareTerminal, Bot, Repeat2 } from 'lucide-astro';

interface Props {
  lang?: Language;
}

const { lang } = Astro.props;
const currentLang = lang || getLangFromUrl(Astro.url);
const t = useTranslations(currentLang);
const isVi = currentLang === 'vi';

const authorFbPostUrl =
  'https://www.facebook.com/mrgoonie/posts/pfbid0p3Q4WRUtQCtupaxQSFjqtqfXbeY3xP3S8vT7shE7WdR71hvPsGQJ4kKVGUyepAG1l';

const pillars = [
  {
    titleKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.pillar1_title' as const,
    subtitleKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.pillar1_subtitle' as const,
    descKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.pillar1_desc' as const,
    Icon: SquareTerminal,
    tone: {
      ring: 'ring-emerald-400/40 dark:ring-emerald-400/30',
      badge: 'from-emerald-500 to-emerald-600',
      kicker: 'text-emerald-700 dark:text-emerald-300',
      glow: 'bg-emerald-200/40 dark:bg-emerald-500/10',
    },
  },
  {
    titleKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.pillar2_title' as const,
    subtitleKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.pillar2_subtitle' as const,
    descKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.pillar2_desc' as const,
    Icon: Bot,
    tone: {
      ring: 'ring-sky-400/40 dark:ring-sky-400/30',
      badge: 'from-sky-500 to-sky-600',
      kicker: 'text-sky-700 dark:text-sky-300',
      glow: 'bg-sky-200/40 dark:bg-sky-500/10',
    },
  },
  {
    titleKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.pillar3_title' as const,
    subtitleKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.pillar3_subtitle' as const,
    descKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.pillar3_desc' as const,
    Icon: Repeat2,
    tone: {
      ring: 'ring-violet-400/40 dark:ring-violet-400/30',
      badge: 'from-violet-500 to-violet-600',
      kicker: 'text-violet-700 dark:text-violet-300',
      glow: 'bg-violet-200/40 dark:bg-violet-500/10',
    },
  },
];

const guideLinks = [
  {
    href: isVi ? '/vi/guides/what-is-claudekit' : '/guides/what-is-claudekit',
    labelKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.link_what_is_ck_label' as const,
    titleKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.link_what_is_ck_title' as const,
    descKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.link_what_is_ck_desc' as const,
    accent: {
      badge: 'bg-purple-100 text-purple-700 dark:bg-purple-950/60 dark:text-purple-300',
      hover: 'hover:border-purple-300 dark:hover:border-purple-800',
      arrow: 'text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-300',
    },
    icon: `<svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 6.042A8.967 8.967 0 006 3.75c-1.052 0-2.062.18-3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 016 18c2.305 0 4.408.867 6 2.292m0-14.25a8.966 8.966 0 016-2.292c1.052 0 2.062.18 3 .512v14.25A8.987 8.987 0 0018 18a8.967 8.967 0 00-6 2.292m0-14.25v14.25"/></svg>`,
  },
  {
    href: isVi ? '/vi/guides/commands' : '/guides/commands',
    labelKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.link_commands_label' as const,
    titleKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.link_commands_title' as const,
    descKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.link_commands_desc' as const,
    accent: {
      badge: 'bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 dark:bg-emerald-950/60 dark:text-emerald-300',
      hover: 'hover:border-emerald-300 dark:hover:border-emerald-800',
      arrow: 'text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-300',
    },
    icon: `<svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M6.75 7.5l3 2.25-3 2.25M12.75 12.75h3.75"/><rect x="3" y="4.5" width="18" height="15" rx="2.25" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>`,
  },
  {
    href: isVi ? '/vi/guides/workflows' : '/guides/workflows',
    labelKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.link_workflows_label' as const,
    titleKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.link_workflows_title' as const,
    descKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.link_workflows_desc' as const,
    accent: {
      badge: 'bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 dark:bg-amber-950/60 dark:text-amber-300',
      hover: 'hover:border-amber-300 dark:hover:border-amber-800',
      arrow: 'text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-300',
    },
    icon: `<svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3.75 12h16.5m-16.5 3.75h16.5M3.75 19.5h16.5M5.625 4.5h12.75a1.875 1.875 0 010 3.75H5.625a1.875 1.875 0 010-3.75z"/></svg>`,
  },
  {
    href: isVi ? '/vi/guides/how-ck-works' : '/guides/how-ck-works',
    labelKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.link_how_ck_works_label' as const,
    titleKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.link_how_ck_works_title' as const,
    descKey: 'deals.what_is_ck.link_how_ck_works_desc' as const,
    accent: {
      badge: 'bg-sky-100 text-sky-700 dark:bg-sky-950/60 dark:text-sky-300',
      hover: 'hover:border-sky-300 dark:hover:border-sky-800',
      arrow: 'text-sky-600 dark:text-sky-300',
    },
    icon: `<svg class="h-5 w-5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9.75 17L9 20l-1 1h8l-1-1-.75-3M3 13.125V6.375A2.25 2.25 0 015.25 4.125h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0121 6.375v6.75M3 13.125A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 15.375h13.5A2.25 2.25 0 0021 13.125M3 13.125v-1.5"/></svg>`,
  },
];
---

<section
  id="what-is-ck"
  class="relative scroll-mt-28 overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-slate-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-50 via-white to-purple-50/40 p-5 dark:border-slate-800 dark:from-slate-950 dark:via-slate-900/40 dark:to-purple-950/30 sm:p-7"
>
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -right-16 -top-16 h-56 w-56 rounded-full bg-purple-200/40 blur-3xl dark:bg-purple-500/10"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>
  <div
    class="pointer-events-none absolute -bottom-20 -left-10 h-48 w-48 rounded-full bg-sky-200/40 blur-3xl dark:bg-sky-500/10"
    aria-hidden="true"
  ></div>

  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="relative mb-7 max-w-3xl">
    <div class="mb-3 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-purple-200 bg-purple-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-purple-700 dark:border-purple-900/60 dark:bg-purple-950/40 dark:text-purple-300">
      <svg class="h-3.5 w-3.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M11.25 11.25l.041-.02a.75.75 0 011.063.852l-.708 2.836a.75.75 0 001.063.853l.041-.021M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0zm-9-3.75h.008v.008H12V8.25z" />
      </svg>
      {t('deals.what_is_ck.kicker')}
    </div>
    <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-black leading-tight text-slate-950 dark:text-white sm:text-4xl">
      {t('deals.what_is_ck.title')}
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-3 text-base leading-7 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-300 sm:text-lg sm:leading-8">
      {t('deals.what_is_ck.subtitle')}
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Pillars -->
  <div class="relative mb-7 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3">
    {pillars.map((pillar) => {
      const PillarIcon = pillar.Icon;
      return (
        <article class="group relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/85 p-5 shadow-sm shadow-slate-900/[0.04] transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:shadow-md dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70">
          <div class={`pointer-events-none absolute -right-8 -top-8 h-24 w-24 rounded-full blur-2xl ${pillar.tone.glow}`} aria-hidden="true"></div>
          <div class={`relative mb-4 inline-flex h-11 w-11 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-gradient-to-br ${pillar.tone.badge} text-white shadow-lg ring-1 ${pillar.tone.ring}`}>
            <PillarIcon size={22} stroke-width={1.8} aria-hidden="true" />
          </div>
          <h3 class={`relative font-heading text-lg font-bold ${pillar.tone.kicker}`}>
            {t(pillar.titleKey)}
          </h3>
          <p class="relative mb-2 mt-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.12em] text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400">
            {t(pillar.subtitleKey)}
          </p>
          <p class="relative text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
            {t(pillar.descKey)}
          </p>
        </article>
      );
    })}
  </div>

  <!-- Origin-story teaser card linking to ClaudeKit author's FB post -->
  <a
    href={authorFbPostUrl}
    target="_blank"
    rel="noopener noreferrer"
    class="group relative mb-7 block overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-blue-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 via-white to-indigo-50 p-5 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-blue-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-blue-900/[0.08] dark:border-blue-900/50 dark:from-blue-950/40 dark:via-slate-900/40 dark:to-indigo-950/30 dark:hover:border-blue-800 sm:p-6"
  >
    <div class="absolute -right-6 -top-6 h-28 w-28 rounded-full bg-blue-200/40 blur-3xl dark:bg-blue-500/10" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="relative flex flex-col gap-4 sm:flex-row sm:items-start sm:gap-5">
      <div class="flex h-12 w-12 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-600 to-indigo-600 text-white shadow-lg shadow-blue-500/30">
        <svg class="h-6 w-6" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M9.101 23.691v-7.98H6.627v-3.667h2.474v-1.58c0-4.085 1.848-5.978 5.858-5.978.401 0 .955.042 1.468.103a8.68 8.68 0 011.141.195v3.325a8.623 8.623 0 00-.653-.036 26.805 26.805 0 00-.733-.009c-.707 0-1.259.096-1.675.309a1.686 1.686 0 00-.679.622c-.258.42-.374.995-.374 1.752v1.297h3.919l-.386 2.103-.287 1.564h-3.246v8.245C19.396 23.238 24 18.179 24 12.044c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12s-12 5.373-12 12c0 5.628 3.874 10.35 9.101 11.647z"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
        <p class="mb-2 text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300">
          {t('deals.what_is_ck.author_quote_kicker')}
        </p>
        <p class="font-heading text-base font-semibold leading-7 text-slate-900 dark:text-white sm:text-lg sm:leading-8">
          {t('deals.what_is_ck.author_quote')}
        </p>
        <div class="mt-3 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-3">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
            <span class="font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">{t('deals.what_is_ck.author_name')}</span>
            <span class="h-1 w-1 rounded-full bg-slate-400 dark:bg-slate-600" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <span>{t('deals.what_is_ck.author_role')}</span>
          </div>
          <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm font-bold text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300">
            {t('deals.what_is_ck.author_cta')}
            <svg class="h-4 w-4 transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13.5 6H5.25A2.25 2.25 0 003 8.25v10.5A2.25 2.25 0 005.25 21h10.5A2.25 2.25 0 0018 18.75V10.5m-10.5 6L21 3m0 0h-5.25M21 3v5.25" />
            </svg>
          </span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </a>

  <!-- Learn more grid -->
  <div class="relative">
    <div class="mb-4 flex flex-col gap-1.5 sm:flex-row sm:items-end sm:justify-between">
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-black text-slate-950 dark:text-white sm:text-2xl">
          {t('deals.what_is_ck.learn_more_title')}
        </h3>
        <p class="mt-1 text-sm text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
          {t('deals.what_is_ck.learn_more_desc')}
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {guideLinks.map((link) => (
        <a
          href={link.href}
          class={`group flex items-start gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 bg-white/85 p-4 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-white hover:shadow-md dark:border-slate-800 dark:bg-slate-900/70 dark:hover:bg-slate-900 ${link.accent.hover}`}
        >
          <div class={`flex h-9 w-9 flex-shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-xl ${link.accent.badge}`}>
            <Fragment set:html={link.icon} />
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
            <div class="mb-1 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class={`rounded-full px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] ${link.accent.badge}`}>
                {t(link.labelKey)}
              </span>
            </div>
            <h4 class="mb-1 font-heading text-base font-bold text-slate-950 dark:text-white">
              {t(link.titleKey)}
            </h4>
            <p class="text-sm leading-6 text-slate-600 dark:text-slate-400">
              {t(link.descKey)}
            </p>
          </div>
          <svg class={`h-5 w-5 flex-shrink-0 transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5 ${link.accent.arrow}`} fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M8.25 4.5l7.5 7.5-7.5 7.5" />
          </svg>
        </a>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Bottom CTA back to claim -->
  <div class="relative mt-7 flex flex-col items-center gap-3 rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-emerald-300 bg-emerald-50/60 px-5 py-4 text-center dark:border-emerald-800/60 dark:bg-emerald-950/30 sm:flex-row sm:justify-between sm:text-left">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-900 dark:text-emerald-200 sm:text-base">
      {t('deals.what_is_ck.cta_ready')}
    </p>
    <a
      href="#claim"
      class="inline-flex min-h-10 items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-600 px-5 py-2 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-lg shadow-emerald-500/30 transition hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-emerald-700 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-4 focus-visible:ring-emerald-300 dark:bg-emerald-500 dark:hover:bg-emerald-400 dark:focus-visible:ring-emerald-800"
    >
      {t('deals.what_is_ck.cta_button')}
      <svg class="h-4 w-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" aria-hidden="true">
        <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19.5 13.5L12 21m0 0l-7.5-7.5M12 21V3" />
      </svg>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
